      "content": "it's not just a mistake though. it's the way they look right through you. like there is no point in even fighting because the system is built to win and you're just meant to fail. everything i've worked for just... evaporated because of a typo. there's no light at the end of this, just more paperwork and more waiting for a life that's already gone.",
